                        "entry_id": "f87ffabf-c64d-39b9-8f48-bf8cece657cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That causes one to become extremely wet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb029763-1c6a-4503-af78-5c1c15a2f4e2",
                                "sense_id": "8a2c5569-665f-3235-b574-e1c7a4289d3b",
                                "text": "We'll be experiencing drenching rain all weekend."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "772bfe22-9a27-46ea-8888-432b741d7adb",
                                "sense_id": "8a2c5569-665f-3235-b574-e1c7a4289d3b",
                                "text": "In its 5 a.m. update, the National Hurricane Center noted that in its initial entry onto land, the storm remains a drenching, windy threat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96ce7261-6e00-464b-bb3f-2a11ed0635fe",
                                "sense_id": "8a2c5569-665f-3235-b574-e1c7a4289d3b",
                                "text": "They walked me through the dynamics of what made this a particularly drenching storm, why Houston is so susceptible to flooding, and whether the decision not to evacuate the city was the right call."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74b0e668-4c82-443b-ae6f-25bde5869053",
                                "sense_id": "8a2c5569-665f-3235-b574-e1c7a4289d3b",
                                "text": "The drenching weather is thanks in part to yet another \"atmospheric river\" flowing in from the west, as well as an air mass that was particularly moist, the weather service said. Sunday ranked in the 95th percentile for how much moisture was in the atmosphere compared to a \"normal\" June 5."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
